     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Advice and instructions",
     "texto": [
      "**Τι πρέπει να κάνω;** means «what should I do?». To give simple advice, the doctor can say **Πρέπει να ξεκουραστείτε** («you must rest»).",
      "**Μην…** expresses a negative instruction: **Μην κουράζεστε** (don't overdo it). **Για τρεις μέρες** means for three days; **αν** means if."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
